    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d7">

                <pb facs="0086" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg6"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roca to President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Argentine people and Government have been profoundly and grievously moved by
                    the death of President McKinley, and while denouncing the infamous crime, which
                    deprives the great sister Republic of the North of its Chief Magistrate and one
                    of its most illustrious and impressive personalities, sends to President
                    Roosevelt and to the American people the expressions of its most sincere
                    condolences.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julio A. Roca</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of the Argentine
                    Republic.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
